			<div style="text-align: center;"><br />
			<img alt="QANTAS_FREIGHT_LOGOjpg" src="" style="max-width: 1306.8189331054687px" title="QANTAS_FREIGHT_LOGOjpg" /></div>

			<div style="text-align: center;"><br />
			&nbsp;</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black; width:601px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; height:328px; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><u><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">AVI {{{Case.Sub_Type_1__c}}} update</span></u></span></span></span></div>
			<br />
			<br />
			<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Hi Team,</span></span></span></span></span><br />
			<br />
			<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please note that the weather in<b> [PORTS] </b>will<b> </b>exceed<b>&nbsp;35</b> <b>degrees</b>&nbsp;on<b> [DATE].</b><br />
			<br />
			Please note that the weather in<b> [PORTS] </b>will<b>&nbsp;</b>be below 5&nbsp;<b>degrees</b>&nbsp;on<b> [DATE].</b></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
			<br />
			<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">All teams - please ensure <b>nil</b>&nbsp;AVI travel if the <b>temperature at time of lodgement is more than 35 degrees or below 5 degrees. If</b>&nbsp;it is less than 35 degrees or more than 5 degrees at time of lodgement, this is managed locally and the terminal can accept if deemed ok.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
			<br />
			<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">CSU will contact the customers holding AVI bookings into and out of these ports that are currently booked at a time that is below 5 degrees or more than 35 degrees.&nbsp;<b>[AGENT]</b> - Can you please action and confirm when completed and ensure via ports have been checked for QF/TL/ZL, <b>with a list of all AVI AWB’s rebooked</b>&nbsp;in a reply email and providing the origin and destination ports, thank you.<br />
			<br />
			<strong>CST - Please suppress ports as below. Remaining ports should be already suppressed as per Extreme Weather suppression list.&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
			&nbsp;
			<table class="MsoTableGrid" style="border-collapse:collapse; border:none">
				
